 ## Background
 Greedy Voxel Mesh Optimization, also known as CEVoxelGreedyOptimizer, originates from an unofficial implementation by Tunied in 2022 [S1, unofficial]. It is designed for optimizing voxel mesh generation in Minecraft-like games. The algorithm is part of a broader family of voxelization optimization techniques. Color Quantization, as a variant/preprocessing step, is associated with the 3DGS-to-Voxel-OpenUSD project by omolism [S2, unofficial].
